{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1557964800, "end_date": 1558655999, "month_true_total": 40, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:52:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "50780675", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112168611", "personaname": "IC17", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198112168611/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 34112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5313, "last_played": 1779869875, "avatar": "5d427e9384ec2ea411b8996431482dcbfb39d54c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "少有的更新频率和内容都让人非常满意的early access游戏，真的是不停地在优化和增加新内容。\n\n游戏本身质量和框架也属于相当不错的，只要不用爆肝式玩法就可以开心地挖很久的矿。", "timestamp_created": 1558611708, "timestamp_updated": 1558611708, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50773457", "author": {"steamid": "76561198396783172", "personaname": "血巨板", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198396783172/", "num_games_owned": 391, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 3137, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1352, "last_played": 1675337326, "avatar": "ffc96a726137064caac1b061af9143e583dcd658"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "ROCK & STONE", "timestamp_created": 1558573848, "timestamp_updated": 1558573848, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50737146", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155453428", "personaname": "AurorA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/4ur0r4/", "num_games_owned": 107, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 76524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3995, "last_played": 1732811802, "avatar": "81868bd70383f8addc1fc7bb5469e84b457962f9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "挖矿挖上瘾了", "timestamp_created": 1558362665, "timestamp_updated": 1558362665, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.57586902379989624", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50729850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198847389172", "personaname": "Maackia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198847389172/", "num_games_owned": 132, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 183088, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12766, "last_played": 1699277881, "avatar": "03a206cb13563b71f1bd7625b5824611de3f7bb1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "强烈推荐，几乎是每天一刷。\n1.打击感很棒，重武器冲锋在前，轻武器灵活飘逸。\n2.环境渲染很出色，不同的地形带来不同的感受，而且，怪物种类也会发生变化，加上一两个前缀，如辐射近卫，寒霜粘液轰炸蝇。\n3.游戏模式多样，不同的模式提供不一样的体验，线式，采集式，猎杀式，开发组也相当良心，不断更新。\n4.职业定位清晰，各有特色，在难度较高的地图，每个职业几乎缺一不可，都有自己的作用。侦察兵勾爪很方便的可以到达一些高处，采掘矿物，而照明枪则是为队伍照明，规避水蛭；枪手绳索枪搭桥铺路，在一些跨度较大的地图中尤为重要，定点输出，在守点时护盾也不可或缺；工程师是侦查兵的好基友，勾爪与平台枪几乎可以达到一切地方，高处的掉落伤害减免也为全队提供了更好的机动性，自动炮塔提供更强的火力加持；钻机手喷射器可以大批量的清理小怪，炸药直接爆掉无畏的盾，大钻头钻出捷径直达空降仓，降低在最后时间段翻车的可能。", "timestamp_created": 1558313310, "timestamp_updated": 1558313310, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 19, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.68154531717300415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "151